    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arthur's Thinking Games is the perfect combination of learning, fun, and helpful features. With 6 different fun-filled activities and 5 levels of difficulty, Arthur's Thinking Games will entertain your child with hours of learning and fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Learn with Arthur</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click on Arthur\u2019s friends to go to a learning activity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fun Facts &amp; Words</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn facts and words with Francine, Muffy and Buster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Logic &amp; Memory</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use logic and memory to get the mummy out of the pyramid.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Kids Learn</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Critical Thinking</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Memory Skills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Problem Solving</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Creativity Skills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Patterns &amp; Sequences</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Science</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Geography</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >History</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Special Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 Skill Levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Art &amp; Music Activities</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arthur's Thinking Games is the perfect combination of learning, fun, and helpful features. With 6 different fun-filled activities and 5 levels of difficulty, Arthur's Thinking Games will entertain your child with hours of learning and fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Learn with Arthur</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click on Arthur\u2019s friends to go to a learning activity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fun Facts &amp; Words</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn facts and words with Francine, Muffy and Buster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Logic &amp; Memory</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use logic and memory to get the mummy out of the pyramid.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Kids Learn</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Critical Thinking</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Memory Skills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Problem Solving</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Creativity Skills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Patterns &amp; Sequences</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Science</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Geography</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >History</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Special Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 Skill Levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Art &amp; Music Activities</p></li></ul>",
